{"id": "REL:SHJ-01-2-015#4", "src": "WAT:SHJ-01-2-015#1", "dst": "WAT:SHJ-01-2-014#1", "type": "connected_to", "layer": "interpretive", "entry": "SHJ-01-2-015", "quote": "又東五百里，曰區吳之山，無草木，多沙石。鹿水出焉，而南流注于滂水。", "status": "proposed", "provenance": {"derived_from": "REL:SHJ-01-2-015#3", "method": "direction_erasure"}}
{"id": "REL:SHJ-01-2-016#1", "src": "WAT:SHJ-01-2-016#1", "dst": "MTN:SHJ-01-2-016#1", "type": "rises_at", "layer": "textual", "entry": "SHJ-01-2-016", "quote": "又東五百里，曰鹿吳之山，上無草木，多金石。澤更之水出焉，而南流注于滂水。水有獸焉，名曰蠱雕，其狀如雕而有角，其音如嬰兒之音，是食人。", "status": "stated"}
{"id": "REL:SHJ-01-2-016#2", "src": "WAT:SHJ-01-2-016#1", "dst": "MTN:SHJ-01-2-016#1", "type": "connected_to", "layer": "interpretive", "entry": "SHJ-01-2-016", "quote": "又東五百里，曰鹿吳之山，上無草木，多金石。澤更之水出焉，而南流注于滂水。水有獸焉，名曰蠱雕，其狀如雕而有角，其音如嬰兒之音，是食人。", "status": "proposed", "provenance": {"derived_from": "REL:SHJ-01-2-016#1", "method": "direction_erasure"}}
