{"id": "REL:SHJ-01-3-004#1", "src": "WAT:SHJ-01-3-004#2", "dst": "MTN:SHJ-01-3-004#1", "type": "rises_at", "layer": "textual", "entry": "SHJ-01-3-004", "quote": "又東五百里，曰發爽之山，無草木，多水，多白猿。汎水出焉，而南流注于渤海。", "status": "stated"}
{"id": "REL:SHJ-01-3-004#2", "src": "WAT:SHJ-01-3-004#2", "dst": "MTN:SHJ-01-3-004#1", "type": "connected_to", "layer": "interpretive", "entry": "SHJ-01-3-004", "quote": "又東五百里，曰發爽之山，無草木，多水，多白猿。汎水出焉，而南流注于渤海。", "status": "proposed", "provenance": {"derived_from": "REL:SHJ-01-3-004#1", "method": "direction_erasure"}}
