{"id": "REL:SHJ-01-3-004#4", "src": "WAT:SHJ-01-3-004#2", "dst": "WAT:SHJ-01-3-003#2", "type": "connected_to", "layer": "interpretive", "entry": "SHJ-01-3-004", "quote": "又東五百里，曰發爽之山，無草木，多水，多白猿。汎水出焉，而南流注于渤海。", "status": "proposed", "provenance": {"derived_from": "REL:SHJ-01-3-004#3", "method": "direction_erasure"}}
{"id": "REL:SHJ-01-3-009#1", "src": "WAT:SHJ-01-3-009#1", "dst": "WAT:SHJ-01-3-009#2", "type": "flows_into", "layer": "textual", "entry": "SHJ-01-3-009", "quote": "又東五百里，曰雞山，其上多金，其下多丹雘。黑水山焉，而南流注于海。其中有鱄魚，其狀如鮒而彘毛，其音如豚，見則天下大旱。", "status": "stated"}
{"id": "REL:SHJ-01-3-009#2", "src": "WAT:SHJ-01-3-009#1", "dst": "WAT:SHJ-01-3-009#2", "type": "connected_to", "layer": "interpretive", "entry": "SHJ-01-3-009", "quote": "又東五百里，曰雞山，其上多金，其下多丹雘。黑水山焉，而南流注于海。其中有鱄魚，其狀如鮒而彘毛，其音如豚，見則天下大旱。", "status": "proposed", "provenance": {"derived_from": "REL:SHJ-01-3-009#1", "method": "direction_erasure"}}
{"id": "REL:SHJ-01-3-013#1", "src": "WAT:SHJ-01-3-013#2", "dst": "MTN:SHJ-01-3-013#1", "type": "rises_at", "layer": "textual", "entry": "SHJ-01-3-013", "quote": "又東五百八十里，曰南禺之山，其上多金玉，其下多水。有穴焉，水出輒入，夏乃出，冬則閉。佐水出焉，而東南流注于海，有鳳皇、鵷鶵。", "status": "stated"}
